// (inverted). So the 🎷 decision-point guard (PIN-TO-NOTHING / CADENCE-CLAMPED / ROTATE-INERT-PINNED) warns where
// a counterproductive choice is MADE, from REAL host-pushed state (Chroma F1/F2), never asserted. Its palette
// global `Wheel` (rotation_palette.slint, slice 10) is already in the compile graph via the dashboard's import.
// HOST-PREVIEW only this wave; the on-device SLINT render is gated by spike #69.
export { RotationSettings } from "rotation_settings.slint";

