// The |||  ADVANCED HAMBURGER (OMEGA Stage-D · D2, charter step 7) — THE SLINT NAVIGATION SURFACE.
// Re-exported from the COMPILED root so `AdvancedBurger` + its `PillarTabRow` private-tab struct
// surface as generated Rust structs through `slint::include_modules!()`. ONE Window carries the |||
// drawer rail, the PER-PILLAR PRIVATE TABS (host-pushed live statuses; DASHBOARD/SETTINGS chips fire
// `open-pillar-dashboard/settings(id)` for the host to route to the pillar Windows until the
// Design-Finale G2 pane refactor embeds them), and TWO REAL EMBEDDED SECTIONS: the overhauled
// DNSCRYPT section (dnscrypt_section.slint — the K5 `DnscryptProxyConfig` typed surface, every
// callback doc-mapped to the typed Record; the `Candle` namesake palette) and the GENERAL section
// (general_section.slint — the SLINT home the retired general-settings .java rows point at). The
// burger root forwards both panes' state/intents as aliases — the host constructs ONE component.
// The host feeds: on-device `android_main` (the D1 #69 rail — since D3 the burger rides BEHIND the
// TortaShell's ||| door, window-swapped on the one event loop) reads the REAL on-disk
// dnscrypt-proxy.toml via `dnscrypt_config_import_or_default` (lib.rs:1223) and applies edits back
// through `dnscrypt_config_to_toml` (VALUE-only, datapath-safe — the module restart stays the
// Kotlin ModulesStateLoop's authority, the D09 law).
export { AdvancedBurger, PillarTabRow } from "advanced_burger.slint";

